# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f apps/game-economy/Dockerfile`
# (per-Dockerfile ignore file), so the repo-root build context stays small
# without a root .dockerignore that would affect other images.
*
!apps/game-economy/Cargo.toml
!apps/game-economy/Cargo.lock
!apps/game-economy/crates
!apps/mint/Cargo.toml
!apps/mint/crates
!apps/mint/contracts
**/target
**/node_modules
